          <div id="div-gpt-ad-1667796770316-0" class="ad-container ad-items" style="min-height: 250px; margin: 15px;" data-id="div-gpt-ad-1667796770316-0" data-minsize="300,250" data-size0="fluid" data-size1="300,250" data-size2="320,100" data-path="/32672392/22_CtiNews_Mobile/22C_Mobile_CP_TopBanner"></div>
        </div><p>2026年地方大選煙硝味已起，台南市議會正迎來縣市合併升格以來最震撼的「世代交替」！隨著年底選戰逼近，台南政壇驚爆史上最大規模的「二代接班」浪潮，多位叱吒風雲的藍綠、無黨籍資深議員紛紛宣布退居幕後。這不只是家族香火的延續，更是一場高學歷「碩士軍團」的政治肉搏戰，預告著台南市議會版圖將面臨全面洗牌。</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1547/1031;" width="1547" height="1031" alt="台南市議會。（圖／臉書）" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" src="/_ipx/w_1080&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768705279-Tkf9kpq.jpg" data-original-src="https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768705279-Tkf9kpq.jpg" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.removeAttribute('srcset');this.removeAttribute('sizes');this.src=this.getAttribute('data-original-src')" srcset="/_ipx/w_480&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768705279-Tkf9kpq.jpg 480w, /_ipx/w_768&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768705279-Tkf9kpq.jpg 768w, /_ipx/w_1080&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768705279-Tkf9kpq.jpg 1080w, /_ipx/w_1440&amp;f_webp/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1768705279-Tkf9kpq.jpg 1440w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, (max-width: 1280px) calc(100vw - 420px), 1066px"><figcaption>台南市議會。（圖／臉書）</figcaption></figure><p><strong>震撼彈一：藍綠老將大換血，6大政治家族推「強棒」</strong></p>
            <ul class="article-promote-items promote-items" style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0px;">
                <li>
                    <a href="https://ctinews.com/news/items/m0x7B0qlav" target="_blank" class="flex items-center">
                        <span class="material-icons-round text-5xl mr-2 flex-shrink-0"> play_circle_outline </span>
                        <span>記憶體生死鬥！散戶是不是要殺進去人氣指標華邦電？</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul><div class="show-in-md">
          <div id="div-gpt-ad-1667796806666-0" class="ad-container ad-items" style="min-height: 250px; margin: 15px;" data-id="div-gpt-ad-1667796806666-0" data-minsize="300,250" data-size0="1,1" data-size1="300,250" data-size2="320,480" data-path="/32672392/22_CtiNews_Mobile/22C_Mobile_CP_MiddleBanner"></div>
        </div><p>這波交棒潮橫跨各黨派，共有6席確定換血，且接班人選來頭都不小，被形容為「贏在起跑點」的超級新人：</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div><p>•史上罕見「兄弟檔」換手： 最具話題性的莫過於第8選區（中西、北區）的民進黨現任議員沈震東。因兵役考量，他宣布將戰袍交給弟弟、成大化學研究所高材生沈震南，上演罕見的「兄傳弟」戲碼。</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div><p>•藍營「女力」交棒： 第3選區國民黨老將尤榮智，早已定調由留美碩士女兒尤淨寬接手；第9選區「安平女兒」林美燕，則派出兒子葉翰勳出征；第10選區資深議員曾培雅，也由擁有台科大碩士學歷的兒子歐政豪接棒。</p>
            <ul class="article-promote-items promote-items" style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0px;">
                <li>
                    <a href="https://ctinews.com/news/items/gGaMoBmGnK" target="_blank" class="flex items-center">
                        <span class="material-icons-round text-5xl mr-2 flex-shrink-0"> play_circle_outline </span>
                        <span>解放軍突闖東沙　專家曝「三大警訊」！</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul><div data-ad-part="true"></div><p>•綠營「連霸王」退休： 在安南區連任6屆的民進黨老將郭清華，感嘆「該退休了」，宣布由英國名校布里斯托大學碩士畢業的女兒郭品辰接棒，喊出「接棒希望、傳辰未來」。</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div><p>&nbsp;無黨轉藍營震撼彈： 永康區無黨籍議員李鎮國拋出震撼彈，宣布不再連任，回歸社區工作。其子李鎮國辦公室執行長李秉倫將接棒，並預計投入「國民黨初選」，為該區選情投下巨大變數。</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div><p><strong>震撼彈二：學歷天花板！這屆「政二代」全是學霸</strong></p>
            <ul class="article-promote-items promote-items" style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0px;">
                <li>
                    <a href="https://ctinews.com/news/items/8knJo049Wo" target="_blank" class="flex items-center">
                        <span class="material-icons-round text-5xl mr-2 flex-shrink-0"> play_circle_outline </span>
                        <span>廖雨詩/隨機重大侵害事件頻傳　如何知道「快逃啊」？</span>
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul><div data-ad-part="true"></div><p>別以為這些「二代」只有家族光環，攤開學歷嚇死人！這場選戰儼然成為「學歷軍備競賽」。從郭品辰的英國名校碩士、尤淨寬的美國南加大（USC）碩士，到李秉倫的台南大學公行碩士、歐政豪的台科大碩士，以及成大研究生的沈震南，這批接班人個個擁有高學歷與專業背景，試圖用實力擺脫「靠爸靠媽」的世襲標籤。</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div><p><strong>震撼彈三：綠營新人「沒特權」？初選恐陷肉搏戰</strong></p><div data-ad-part="true"></div><p>儘管擁有家族資源，但想接班可沒那麼容易！民進黨為回應社會觀感，祭出嚴格的「政二代條款」。凡是現任公職三親等內的親屬，在初選民調中「完全不予加權」。這意味著像沈震南、郭品辰這樣的綠營新人，必須在初選中「實打實」地與其他強敵肉搏，沒有任何捷徑可走。</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div><p>面對這場「空戰」與「陸戰」交織的現代化選戰，這批背負著家族期待的「最強二代們」，能否順利通過選民的檢驗，將是2026台南選戰最精彩的看點。</p><div data-ad-part="true"></div></div></div><div data-v-9f7e13a7><span data-v-9f7e13a7></span><span data-v-9f7e13a7></span></div><ul class="promote-items mt-5 grid grid-flow-row gap-5 font-bold text-theme-2 em:text-xl md:text-lg leading-tight" data-v-9f7e13a7><!--[--><!--]--></ul></main><footer class="article__footer mt-10" data-v-9f7e13a7><!----><!----><div class="tags py-8 lg:py-5 border-t border-b border-gray-50 mt-5" data-v-9f7e13a7><div class="flex flex-row" data-v-9f7e13a7><p class="text-lg black flex-shrink-0 mt-1" data-v-9f7e13a7> 標籤： </p><div class="group flex flex-row flex-wrap items-center -m-1 text-base" data-v-9f7e13a7><!----><!--[--><a href="/tags/2026%E9%81%B8%E6%88%B0" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">2026選戰</p></a><a href="/tags/%E5%8F%B0%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E6%9C%83" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">台南市議會</p></a><a href="/tags/%E6%94%BF%E4%BA%8C%E4%BB%A3" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">政二代</p></a><a href="/tags/%E5%88%9D%E9%81%B8" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">初選</p></a><a href="/tags/%E5%8F%B0%E5%8D%97%E5%B8%82%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">台南市議員選舉</p></a><a href="/tags/%E8%B3%B4%E6%B8%85%E5%BE%B7" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">賴清德</p></a><a href="/tags/%E5%8F%B0%E5%8D%97" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">台南</p></a><a href="/tags/2026%E5%A4%A7%E9%81%B8" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">2026大選</p></a><a href="/tags/%E8%B3%B4%E6%B8%85%E5%BE%B7%E6%9C%AC%E5%91%BD%E5%8D%80" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">賴清德本命區</p></a><a href="/tags/%E7%B8%BD%E7%B5%B1%E6%9C%AC%E5%91%BD%E5%8D%80" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">總統本命區</p></a><a href="/tags/%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E5%AE%B6%E6%97%8F" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="m-1 flex-shrink-0"><p class="px-2 py-0.5 text-primary bg-[#cbebff] text-center rounded-sm text-sm whitespace-nowrap leading-relaxed">政治家族</p></a><!--]--></div></div></div><span data-v-9f7e13a7></span></footer></article><footer class="news-items__footer"><div class="ad-min-space" style="min-width:1px;min-height:250px;"><span></span></div><div id="taboola-slot" class="border-b border-gray-50 py-20 md:py-10"><div id="taboola-below-article-thumbnails" class="taboola-container" style="min-height:250px;"></div></div><div><div class="related-section border-b border-gray-50 py-10"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-5 lg:mb-6"><h2 class="text-3xl">相關報導</h2><!----></div><div class="related-news"><!--[--><div class="base-card base-card-sm grid grid-flow-col theme-default with-image"><div class="base-card__image relative self-start"><div class="base-news-img" style="aspect-ratio:176 / 118;"><img onerror="this.setAttribute(&#39;data-error&#39;, 1)" width="176" height="118" alt="沈伯洋罵老人免健保費　賴清德讚「這樣妥當了」！藍酸：誰看得懂？" loading="eager" data-nuxt-img srcset="/_ipx/f_webp&amp;q_80&amp;fit_cover&amp;s_176x118/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1792240424-kFxw615.PNG 1x, /_ipx/f_webp&amp;q_80&amp;fit_cover&amp;s_352x236/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1792240424-kFxw615.PNG 2x" draggable="false" fetchpriority="auto" src="/_ipx/f_webp&amp;q_80&amp;fit_cover&amp;s_176x118/https://storage.ctinews.com/compression/files/default/cut-1792240424-kFxw615.PNG"></div><a href="/news/items/KwnKLbo7WY" class="news-link absolute inset-0 alt-text" title="沈伯洋罵老人免健保費　賴清德讚「這樣妥當了」！藍酸：誰看得懂？"><!--[-->沈伯洋罵老人免健保費　賴清德讚「這樣妥當了」！藍酸：誰看得懂？<!--]--></a><div class="video-icon"><span></span></div></div><div class="base-card__content grid grid-flow-row em:gap-3"><div class="grid grid-flow-row auto-rows-min em:gap-3"><!----><div class="base-card__news-title"><a href="/news/items/KwnKLbo7WY" class="news-link" title="沈伯洋罵老人免健保費　賴清德讚「這樣妥當了」！藍酸：誰看得懂？"><!--[--><!--[-->沈伯洋罵老人免健保費　賴清德讚「這樣妥當了」！藍酸：誰看得懂？<!--]--><!--]--></a></div></div><div class="self-end grid grid-flow-col gap-2 place-content-between"><div class="base-card__news-info whitespace-nowrap"><span></span><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="base-car